  "description": "It was a hasty, arranged marriage. And on their wedding night, he ran away.\n\nHe lived for ten years under a false name, becoming one of the seven Great Masters of the Continent, but returned home when he heard news of his father’s passing.\n\nThere, he found his wife, whom he had thought had already left, whom he had only seen once before.\n\nShe was still as beautiful as the first time he saw her.\n\n**Original Novel:**     \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64317480), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11846376), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/6038006535), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/detail/E000132070), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H046563016), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H046563016), [KyoboBook](https://ebook-product.kyobobook.co.kr/dig/epd/ebook/E000006945330) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851027), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14200331)",
